{
  "_guide": {
    "standing": "A long slow stab with drag. If used with revealed (i.e. after attacks), becomes a very fast jab with very short drag for annoyance and followups",
    "falling": "jab down and drag the mob along with you, pinning and wetting them if they hit the ground with water splash particles.",
    "aerial": "sweep your hand across the screen and throw a net that pins and distracts enemies, no direct damage",
    "sprinting": "charge through with block frames leaving a trail of water that wets enemies",
    "guard counter": "skewer the mob and throw them skywards.",
    "throw": "non-piercing embedding throw, spawns lightning at full spirit. Pickup flourish only available at full spirit.",
    "pickup": "twirl the trident behind you and point at where you're looking, summoning an elder guardian one-two at target location or mob.",
    "draw": "throw a net that pins and confuses. "
  },
